@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About";
}

<div class="text-center">
    <h1 class="display-4">The Re-Waste Mission</h1>

    <p>
        Re-Waste is designed to help people make better
        decisions about their old phones. By answering a few simple questions,
        users can find out whether their phone could be repaired, resold,
        donated or recycled.
    </p>

    <h2>What does Re-Waste do?</h2>
    <p>
        Re-Waste asks users a few simple questions about their phone,
        such as its age and condition. Based on their answers,
        the website suggests whether the phone could be repaired,
        resold, donated or recycled.
    </p>

    <h2>Why is Re-Waste important?</h2>
    <p>
        Many people have old phones that they no longer use.
        Re-Waste aims to make it easier for people to understand
        their options and give their devices another chance
        instead of throwing them away.
    </p>

    <h2>Our goal</h2>
    <p>
        Our goal is to make it easier for people to decide
        what to do with their old phones and encourage
        them to reuse or recycle their devices where possible.
    </p>
</div>
